---
// PrintableMemo.astro - Feature 17: Printable Classified Intelligence Briefing Memo
---
<div class="hud-panel hud-corner memo-card">
  <div class="memo-header no-print">
    <div>
      <div class="memo-title-row">
        <span class="badge badge-pantone-2021">EXECUTIVE BRIEFING FORMAT</span>
        <h3 class="font-mono memo-heading">CLASSIFIED INTELLIGENCE MEMO GENERATOR</h3>
      </div>
      <p class="font-mono text-muted" style="font-size: 0.76rem;">One-click formatted intelligence brief ready for Print to PDF or subscriber distribution.</p>
    </div>

    <button class="btn-tactical btn-primary font-mono" id="printMemoBtn">
      <span>🖨 PRINT TO PDF / EXPORT</span>
    </button>
  </div>

  <!-- The Document to Print -->
  <div class="classified-memo-paper font-mono" id="memoDoc">
    <div class="memo-watermark">CREATOR EYES ONLY</div>

    <div class="memo-doc-head">
      <div class="memo-banner-tag">STRATEGIC INTELLIGENCE MEMORANDUM</div>
      <div class="memo-meta-grid">
        <div class="m-row"><strong>DATE:</strong> 11 NOVEMBER 2026</div>
        <div class="m-row"><strong>THEATER:</strong> WESTERN PACIFIC & PERSIAN GULF MARITIME CHOKEPOINTS</div>
        <div class="m-row"><strong>CLASSIFICATION:</strong> TACTICAL UNCLASSIFIED / CREATOR DOSSIER</div>
        <div class="m-row"><strong>DISPATCH CODE:</strong> ISKANDER-2026-ALPHA</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="memo-doc-body">
      <h3 class="doc-sec-title">1. OPERATIONAL SITUATION ASSESSMENT</h3>
      <p class="doc-para font-sans">
        Over-the-horizon reconnaissance indicates that surface combatants entering the contested littoral envelope face multi-axis saturation threats. Commercial shipping vulnerability in the Southern Red Sea and Strait of Hormuz has demonstrated that weaponized commercial drones ($20,000) create extreme cost-asymmetry against frontline navies expending $2.2M interceptor munitions per engagement.
      </p>

      <h3 class="doc-sec-title">2. KINETIC SYSTEMS ENVELOPE (ISKANDER-M & A2/AD)</h3>
      <p class="doc-para font-sans">
        Flight telemetry confirms Iskander-M (9M723) quasi-ballistic systems maintain an apogee inside the stratosphere (50 km) while conducting 30G terminal evasive maneuvers. Reaction time for point-defense Aegis SPY-6 or Patriot PAC-3 batteries at 350 km engagement ranges is compressed to less than 45 seconds.
      </p>

      <h3 class="doc-sec-title">3. STRATEGIC LOGISTICS & ECONOMIC IMPACT</h3>
      <p class="doc-para font-sans">
        A sustained 75% naval interdiction at the Strait of Hormuz removes approximately 15.75 million barrels/day of petroleum liquids from spot markets, triggering an instantaneous +$38.50/bbl crude spike and rerouting commercial maritime trade around the Cape of Good Hope (+14 days sailing time, +$1.1M fuel surcharges per vessel).
      </p>

      <div class="doc-signature-block">
        <div class="sig-line">
          <span>AUTHORIZED INTELLIGENCE DISPATCH</span>
          <span style="color: var(--primary);">PORTAL HOST: ISKANDER.DBDD.IN // CLOUDFLARE PAGES</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<script is:inline>
  document.getElementById('printMemoBtn')?.addEventListener('click', () => {
    window.print();
  });
</script>

<style>
  .memo-card {
    padding: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .memo-header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: flex-end;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    padding-bottom: 1rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(147, 149, 151, 0.15);
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .memo-title-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.65rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  .memo-heading {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--text-main);
  }

  .classified-memo-paper {
    background: #090C10;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    padding: 2.5rem 3rem;
    border-radius: 4px;
    position: relative;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
  }

  .memo-watermark {
    position: absolute;
    top: 45%;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%) rotate(-30deg);
    font-size: 4rem;
    font-weight: 900;
    color: rgba(187, 38, 73, 0.05);
    pointer-events: none;
    white-space: nowrap;
    border: 6px dashed rgba(187, 38, 73, 0.08);
    padding: 1rem 2rem;
  }

  .memo-doc-head {
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--border-color);
    padding-bottom: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .memo-banner-tag {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 900;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--primary);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .memo-meta-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    font-size: 0.76rem;
  }

  .doc-sec-title {
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--primary);
    margin: 1.5rem 0 0.5rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  .doc-para {
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    color: var(--text-main);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .doc-signature-block {
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    padding-top: 1.5rem;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(147, 149, 151, 0.2);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
  }

  .sig-line {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
  }

  @media print {
    body * {
      visibility: hidden;
    }
    .classified-memo-paper,
    .classified-memo-paper * {
      visibility: visible;
    }
    .classified-memo-paper {
      position: absolute;
      left: 0;
      top: 0;
      width: 100%;
      background: white !important;
      color: black !important;
      border: none;
      box-shadow: none;
      padding: 0;
    }
    .no-print {
      display: none !important;
    }
    .memo-banner-tag,
    .doc-sec-title,
    .sig-line span {
      color: black !important;
    }
    .doc-para {
      color: #222 !important;
    }
  }
</style>
